# Helix product scope

This API is an LLM pipeline over a SELECT-only warehouse. It is not a business CRUD app.

## Do

- Introspect allowlisted catalog (`tables.md` / docs)
- Execute SELECT (or CTE + SELECT) via `execute_select` / `validate_select`
- Return `{ text_report, grid, echarts_option }` per `mode`

## Do not

- Add entity CRUD, write SQL APIs, EXEC / stored-procedure reports, or a dashboard product type
- Invent modes outside `VALID_MODES` in `backend/api/demo.py`
- Drop `grid` from `_package_result` in `backend/api/pipeline_run.py`

Pipeline markdown lives in `backend/analytics/agents/` (source) and `backend/markdown-files/` (runtime; seed-if-empty — update both).
